  "summary_text": "Northwind Teams launch\nBlocker: SSO session tokens don't expire\nProcess and handoff and api versioning\nSuggestion to keep it behind a flag before touching process\nHandoff is surprisingly okay\nApi versioning is low risk\nSuggestion to agree on what done means before touching api versioning\nPreference to start with the boring version rather than do a proper write-up\nTracing setup and test fixtures and communication plan\nTracing setup is pretty solid\nTest fixtures is mostly cosmetic\nReal issue may be monorepo tooling rather than communication plan\nPreference to park it for now rather than do a quick spike\nProgress updates\nDone: complete the Corvid Bank security questionnaire (Yusuf)\nNext steps\nSam to fix SSO session token expiry by Wednesday",
  "summary_markdown": "### Northwind Teams launch\n- Blocker: SSO session tokens don't expire\n\n### Process and handoff and api versioning\n- Suggestion to keep it behind a flag before touching process\n- Handoff is surprisingly okay\n- Api versioning is low risk\n  - Suggestion to agree on what done means before touching api versioning\n- Preference to start with the boring version rather than do a proper write-up\n\n### Tracing setup and test fixtures and communication plan\n- Tracing setup is pretty solid\n- Test fixtures is mostly cosmetic\n- Real issue may be monorepo tooling rather than communication plan\n- Preference to park it for now rather than do a quick spike\n\n### Progress updates\n- **Done:** complete the Corvid Bank security questionnaire (Yusuf)\n\n### Next steps\n- Sam to fix SSO session token expiry by **Wednesday**",
  "private_notes_text": null,
  "private_notes_markdown": null,
  "transcript": [
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Dev Iyer"
      },
      "text": "Okay I think we're good to start.",
