    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Dev Iyer"
      },
      "text": "Yeah. if the requirements slips again, Northwind Teams is going to feel it. I guess it's funny, the error like budget looked pretty close before this call and now it's not as bad as it sounded.",
