      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:04:00.051000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Patel"
      },
      "text": "The short version the handoff is surprisingly surprisingly okay, which is fine. So the API versioning is low risk, but the cron jobs is unclear",
