      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:04:09.982000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Dev Iyer"
      },
      "text": "For what it's worth, I'd rather start with the boring version than do a proper write-up, I think.",
