      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:04:30.878000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Anyway, I put some notes on the requirements in the doc...",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:04:34.533000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:04:38.200000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Patel"
      },
      "text": "Okay, so I'd rather park it for now than do a quick spike, kind of.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:04:38.204000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:04:43.204000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Patel"
      },
      "text": "Look, for the team plan specifically, the pagination bug is the blocker, at least for now.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:04:43.958000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:04:49.291000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, the read replicas is a bit messy, but the runbook is mostly fine.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:04:49.366000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:04:54.033000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Patel"
      },
      "text": "So I don't know if the timeout settings is really the issue, in my opinion...",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:04:54.532000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:04:59.532000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Patel"
      },
      "text": "Yeah no, I wouldn't block on the alerting thresholds, if that helps.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:05:00.221000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:05:04.221000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Patel"
      },
      "text": "Oh, we keep going back and forth on the pagination bug.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:05:04.283000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:05:07.950000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Patel"
      },
      "text": "I'd rather test it with a few users than do it properly,",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:05:08.728000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:05:12.728000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yep, yep.",
