      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:05:13.417000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Patel"
      },
      "text": "Which, it's like, the backlog is hard to reason about and and nobody wants to say it.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:05:13.488000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:05:19.154000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Patel"
      },
      "text": "Well",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:05:26.398000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:05:26.998000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Patel"
      },
      "text": "I feel like the timeline is a known issue, to be honest.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:05:27.010000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:05:31.010000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Patel"
      },
      "text": "I spent 90 minutes on the queue consumer and it seems to come and go...",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:05:31.072000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:05:36.072000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Dev Iyer"
      },
      "text": "Okay.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:05:36.092000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:05:36.692000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Dev Iyer"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, I think the dependencies is a little behind and the logging format is way more complicated than it looks, so maybe go back to the original plan. Well, the last time we touched the release checklist it was mostly cosmetic, I think. But does the batch batch size actually matter for Northwind Teams? Anyway, that's basically what we saw with the next steps on the team plan. So I talked to a couple of folks on support about the service boundaries and they pushed back a bit. you know, Also, it's like, the open questions is sort of on hold and nobody wants to say it. Which, Northwind Teams is is kind of test case for the cron jobs and stuff.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:05:36.775000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:06:17.775000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Kim"
      },
      "text": "Oh, our solutions engineer keep asking about the flaky integration tests.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:06:19.157000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:06:22.823000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "I spent a week or two on the service boundaries and it's honestly fine. Also, does the API versioning actually matter for the team plan? Also, the error budget is basically done, but the dashboards is a bit of a black box. Yeah, on Northwind Teams, half of it is outdated, but yeah",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:06:22.826000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:06:40.493000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Dev Iyer"
      },
      "text": "Right.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:06:37.122000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:06:37.722000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "I just want to make sure the retry logic doesn't fall through the cracks.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:06:42.159000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:06:46.825000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Dev Iyer"
      },
      "text": "Okay, yeah.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:06:44.571000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:06:45.171000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Sorry",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:06:47.249000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:06:47.849000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "do we know like who's looking at the original proposal?",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:06:48.315000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:06:51.648000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "I'm not convinced the connection pool like is a known issue, you know what I mean.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:06:51.697000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:06:57.030000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah no, for Northwind Teams, I think the scope is the part that's pretty close.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:07:03.261000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:07:08.261000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "But part of me wants to just ship the smaller version",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:07:08.303000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:07:11.970000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "part of me thinks it's way more complicated than it looks.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:07:13.104000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:07:16.771000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Plus the cron jobs came up a while back too, at least for now.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:07:18.610000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:07:23.277000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "I wouldn't block on the staging deploy.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:07:23.334000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:07:25.668000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Patel"
      },
      "text": "Oh, interesting.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:07:24.913000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:07:25.513000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Okay.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:07:25.940000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:07:26.540000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Dev Iyer"
      },
      "text": "And.",
      "start_time": "2026-10-13T14:07:26.621000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-10-13T14:07:27.221000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Oh, the team plan is like kind of the test case for the dead letter queue, I think. Yeah, I keep coming back to the test fixtures, at least for now.",
